<title>USA: First Citizens Financial Corp Q3 loss.</title>
<headline>First Citizens Financial Corp Q3 loss.</headline>
<dateline>GAITHERSBURG, Md. 1996-10-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996			1995</p>
<p> Shr loss		   $0.16   profit	 $0.33</p>
<p> Net loss		     505   profit	 1,044</p>
<p>	   9 MONTHS</p>
<p> Shr profit		 $0.54   profit	 $0.94</p>
<p> Net profit		 1,722   profit	 2,945</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: 1996 periods include a charge of $3.0 million from SAIF assessment for deposit insurance.</p>
<p>Q3 net interest income: $4.9 million vs $4.3 million.  </p>
<p>Deposit insurance charge totals $0.58 a share.</p>
<p>Nine month net interest income: $13.9 million vs $13.4 million.</p>
<p>1995 earnings per share restated for 10 percent stock dividend issued June 3, 1996.</p>
<p>Total assets at Sept. 30, 1996: $668.5 million.</p>
<p>Total loans at Sept. 30, 1996: $470.7 million.</p>
<p>Total deposits at Sept. 30, 1996: $509.4 million.</p>
